@startuml
title 分析类图（六）— 采编协同用例职责
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
left to right direction
hide empty members
class "提交采编协同需求控制" as CUCED001 <<control>> {
  + 提交采编协同需求(业务信息)
}
class "派发采编同步任务控制" as CUCED002 <<control>> {
  + 派发采编同步任务(业务信息)
}
class "提交采编同步结果控制" as CUCED003 <<control>> {
  + 提交采编同步结果(业务信息)
}
class "审核并归档采编协同控制" as CUCED004 <<control>> {
  + 审核并归档采编协同(业务信息)
}
class "普通成员接口" as B0 <<boundary>>
class "部长接口" as B1 <<boundary>>
class "管理员接口" as B2 <<boundary>>
class "成员" as E0 <<entity>>
class "采编协同" as E4 <<entity>>
B0 ..> CUCED001 : UC-ED-001
CUCED001 ..> E4 : 委派责任
CUCED001 ..> E0 : 委派责任
B1 ..> CUCED002 : UC-ED-002
CUCED002 ..> E4 : 委派责任
CUCED002 ..> E0 : 委派责任
B0 ..> CUCED003 : UC-ED-003
CUCED003 ..> E4 : 委派责任
CUCED003 ..> E0 : 委派责任
B2 ..> CUCED004 : UC-ED-004
CUCED004 ..> E4 : 委派责任
CUCED004 ..> E0 : 委派责任
note "实体属性与操作详见前四张类图；\n实体间协作详见对应序列图。\n虚线表示职责依赖，不表示业务流转先后。" as Guidance
@enduml
